        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Classic side-scrolling platformer starring the Android robot"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Replica Island is a complete 2D side-scrolling platformer starring the green Android robot on a quest to locate a mysterious power source on a peculiar island.\n\nFeatures of this modernized edition:\n• Complete 40-level classic campaign with dialogues, secret levels, challenging boss fights, and 3 unique endings.\n• Modernized build system and toolchain targeting Android 15+ (SDK 35) with support for modern 64-bit devices.\n• Updated tilt controls using modern Android rotation vectors alongside on-screen virtual slider controls.\n• Fixed landscape display mode for modern widescreen ratios.\n• Free and open-source under the Apache 2.0 license.\n"
        },
