        "authorName": "Tobias Bielefeld",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Simple Brick Games"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Classic LCD handheld 9999-in-1 brick games"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Simple Brick Games recreates the nostalgic low-cost LCD brick handheld consoles (Brick Game 9999 in 1) with authentic retro charm and modern Android support.\n\nFeatures:\n• 14 classic mini-games including Falling Blocks, Tanks, Racing, Snake, Brick Breaker, Frogger, and Shooting.\n• Authentic monochrome LCD display with customizable brick textures and backlight colors.\n• Customizable handheld body shells and button color themes.\n• Adjustable difficulty, starting level, and speed for each individual game.\n• Separate highscore tracking for each mini-game.\n• Support for physical keyboard and gamepad button mapping alongside on-screen tactile controls.\n• Tactile haptic feedback modernized for contemporary Android devices.\n• Modernized build targeting Android 15+ (SDK 35) with universal compatibility across all modern architectures.\n• Free and open-source under the GPLv3+ license.\n"
        },
        "icon": {
