        "authorName": "Daniel Heck & SeeSchloss",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Enigma"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Classic marble-rolling puzzle game inspired by Oxyd and Marble Madness"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Enigma is a classic puzzle and arcade game inspired by Oxyd and Marble Madness.\n\nThe object of the game is to find and uncover matching pairs of Oxyd stones using a rolling marble. Watch out for traps, lasers, moving floors, one-way paths, and hundreds of physics-based puzzles!\n\nFeatures of the Revived edition:\n• Over 1,000 diverse levels (including classic Oxyd and Enigma level packs).\n• Modernized engine supporting 64-bit CPUs (ARM64) and Android 14/15/16+.\n• Touchscreen controls and Gyro/Accelerometer support (tilt your device to roll the marble).\n• Compliant with 16 KB page-size alignment for modern hardware.\n• Full soundtrack and sound effects.\n"
        },
