        "authorName": "P1X (Krzysztof Jankowski & Team)",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Tanks of Freedom"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Indie turn-based tactical strategy in isometric 32-colour pixel art"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Tanks of Freedom is a classic turn-based tactical strategy game with two armies fighting against each other.\n\nChallenge yourself in single-player story campaigns against the AI or enjoy intense hot-seat battles with a friend on a single device. Built using Godot Engine, every unit and tile is handcrafted in gorgeous 32-colour isometric pixel art, accompanied by an authentic chiptune soundtrack.\n\nFeatures of this modernized Android release:\n• Single-player story campaigns across varied seasons and terrains (Summer, Fall, Winter).\n• Local hot-seat multiplayer for two players on the same phone or tablet.\n• Built-in tactical map editor to create, play, and share custom battlefields.\n• Diverse unit roster: Infantry, Tanks, Mobile Artillery, and Helicopters with tactical AP mechanics.\n• Updated 64-bit engine support (ARM64 & x86_64) for modern Android devices.\n• 100% free and open-source under the MIT license, with zero ads or tracking.\n"
        },
