        "authorName": "P1X (Krzysztof Jankowski & Team)",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "Tanks of Freedom II"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Classic turn-based strategy in an isometric voxel 3D world"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "Tanks of Freedom II is the 3D sequel to the beloved turn-based tactical strategy game. Built from the ground up on Godot Engine 4, it brings charming isometric voxel aesthetics, tactical depth, and modern touch optimization to Android.\n\nTake command of your forces, capture key production buildings, manage action points (AP), and outmaneuver the enemy across challenging single-player campaign missions, skirmishes, or local hot-seat multiplayer.\n\nFeatures of this modernized Android release:\n• Modern Godot 4 3D engine with Vulkan Mobile rendering.\n• Handcrafted voxel style with dynamic terrain, rivers, bridges, and weather effects.\n• Complete single-player story campaign and customizable skirmish modes.\n• Local hot-seat multiplayer for intense head-to-head battles on one device.\n• Tactile touchscreen controls with intuitive 3D tile selection and mobile HUD.\n• Full 64-bit ARM64 native binary compatible with modern Android releases (14/15/16/17+).\n• 100% free and open-source under the MIT license, with zero ads or tracking.\n"
        },
