        "authorName": "Kelvin Shadewing",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "SuperTux Advance"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Charming retro 2D platformer powered by Brux GDK"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "SuperTux Advance is a 2D retro platformer featuring Tux the penguin, Penny, and Gwendolyn on a quest across expansive worlds packed with enemies, secret areas, powerups, boss fights, time attack challenges, and custom levels.\n\nFeatures of this modernized Android edition:\n• Low-latency virtual touch controls (8-way D-pad, action buttons, pause/swap) rendered natively through SDL2.\n• Dynamic display autofit automatically adapting to modern panoramic screens (19:9, 20:9, 21:9) without letterboxing.\n• Native 64-bit binaries with 16 KB page-size ELF alignment for Android 15+.\n• Rendering and background glitch fixes eliminating parallax tiling artifacts and ghosting.\n• Hardened audio subsystem preventing sound dropouts and audio channel corruption.\n• Full support for physical gamepads and keyboard input alongside on-screen touch controls.\n• Free and open-source under GPLv3 / AGPLv3.\n"
        },
